SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Ivan Yanakov in Concert: A Bali Children Foundation Fundraiser at P
 adma Resort Legian
LOCATION:Padma Resort Legian
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, 3 October 2026\, A Night With Purpose will unfold
  in the Plumeria Grand Ballroom\, Padma Resort Legian. This magical evenin
 g is a one-of-a-kind fundraising dinner for Bali Children Foundation\, a g
 ala dinner and concert featuring internationally-acclaimed pianist\, Ivan 
 Yanakov. This will be an evening of elegance\, featuring wines and canapé
 s\, a seated dinner in the ballroom\, accompanied by the world-class piano
  recital. Ivan Yanakov\, also an acclaimed conductor\, has performed in mo
 re than 3o countries\, and most recently recorded Rachmaninoff’s Piano C
 oncerto No. 3 with the London Symphony Orchestra. The musician returns to 
 Bali for this special occasion\, bringing with him a musical programme ins
 pired by his Bulgarian roots\, set to perform works by Dobrinka Tabakova a
 nd Pancho Vladigerov\, as well as more recognisable pieces from Chopin\, G
 ershwin and Rachmaninoff. Of course\, A Night With Purpose is centred on r
 aising funds for Bali Children Foundation\, namely youth empowerment progr
 ammes in North Bali\, including the development of the Angela Wheelton You
 th Centre\, named after BCF’s late Australian Director.\n\nMore info: ht
 tps://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/ivan-yanakov-in-concert-a-bali-chi
 ldren-foundation-fundraiser-at-padma-resort-legian/\n\nPlease verify with 
 the organizer before attending.
URL:https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/ivan-yanakov-in-concert-a-bal
 i-children-foundation-fundraiser-at-padma-resort-legian/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f307d8e871810b8f23ca81f65f455e664e158ca1@lewagon-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261002T212859Z
SEQUENCE:1
SUMMARY:IGNITE 2026
LOCATION:Green School Bali
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, 3 October 2026 \, Green School Foundation’s fun
 draising gala\, IGNITE \, returns for its eighth edition. This prestigious
  annual event is a cultural and culinary spectacle\, taking place at the w
 orld-renowned campus of Green School Bali . IGNITE 2026 presents the theme
  ‘ Chronicles of Nusantara’ \, celebrating Indonesia’s land\, tradit
 ions and living heritage. As such\, the gala dinner’s feast will be cura
 ted by none other than Indonesia’s culinary ambassador\, Chef William Wo
 ngso \, known for his expertise with archipelagic flavours and recipes. He
  will be joined by Chef Jero Yudi from Dapur Bali Mula\, a Balinese chef r
 enowned for his traditional dishes using local ingredients. The Green Scho
 ol Foundation’s mission is to empower the next generation of environment
 al leaders. Their work encompasses Environmental School Projects \, bringi
 ng sustainability education programmes to local schools\, as well as provi
 ding Agricultural University Scholarships for children of farmers\, ensuri
 ng a resilient future for Indonesia’s agricultural industry. Through ‘
 Chronicles of Nusantara’\, this year’s IGNITE will draw the connection
  between land and culture – that the rice on our plates\, bamboo for hom
 es\, fibres for textiles all originate from Indonesia’s diverse landscap
 e and those who tend them.\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcomin
 g-events/ignite-2026/\n\nPlease verify with the organizer before attending
 .
URL:https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/ignite-2026/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
END:VEVENT
