 me its visionary founder\, Chef Enrico Bartolini\, for an intimate evening
  of Italian cuisine\, fine wine and convivial dining. Held on Sunday\, 4 O
 ctober 2026\, the one-night culinary collaboration brings Chef Enrico toge
 ther with AMICI’s Chef Alessandro D’Amico for a special five-course di
 nner. The evening begins with a canapé reception from 6pm to 7pm \, befor
 e guests take their seats for dinner at 7.30pm . Served across AMICI’s e
 legant indoor dining room and open-air veranda\, the menu will bring toget
 her the restaurant’s contemporary interpretation of Italian cuisine with
  Chef Enrico’s distinctive style. While the full menu will be revealed o
 n the evening\, one signature dish has already been unveiled: Risotto Enri
 co Bartolini \, the chef’s celebrated beetroot “Acquerello” risotto\
 , finished with butter\, Gorgonzola and walnuts. The collaboration is desi
 gned not simply as a progression of courses\, but as a meeting of culinary
  perspectives\, with technique\, tradition and personal expression at the 
 heart of the experience.\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-
 events/amici-presents-an-exclusive-evening-with-chef-enrico-bartolini/\n\n
